    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607150/extras/2bf5b7f19836dc37daa1d767ffac1777.avif?t=1753348587\" data-has-big width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>space survival builder</strong>. You've crash-landed on an asteroid, and your O\u2082 supply is running low. Build a survival base quickly, repair your ship, and escape. Will you survive the vast emptiness of space?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore &amp; Mine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dig Deep into the Asteroid:</strong> Excavate the asteroid's core and uncover precious ores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607150/extras/b111f52e0088b6338f10fb34b3245f9a.poster.avif?t=1753348587\" width=536 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607150/extras/b111f52e0088b6338f10fb34b3245f9a.webm?t=1753348587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607150/extras/b111f52e0088b6338f10fb34b3245f9a.mp4?t=1753348587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Base</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Establish a Secure Outpost:</strong> Create a functional base to escape the harsh realities of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607150/extras/f37b8221edcc781d4be51c96aed81a48.poster.avif?t=1753348587\" width=536 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607150/extras/f37b8221edcc781d4be51c96aed81a48.webm?t=1753348587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607150/extras/f37b8221edcc781d4be51c96aed81a48.mp4?t=1753348587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Void</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage Your Oxygen Supply:</strong> In the unforgiving vacuum of space, oxygen is your most critical resource.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607150/extras/ed7dc1e6fe42bcf0ae5929b7bd09ed33.poster.avif?t=1753348587\" width=536 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607150/extras/ed7dc1e6fe42bcf0ae5929b7bd09ed33.webm?t=1753348587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607150/extras/ed7dc1e6fe42bcf0ae5929b7bd09ed33.mp4?t=1753348587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607150/extras/2bf5b7f19836dc37daa1d767ffac1777.avif?t=1753348587\" data-has-big width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>space survival builder</strong>. You've crash-landed on an asteroid, and your O\u2082 supply is running low. Build a survival base quickly, repair your ship, and escape. Will you survive the vast emptiness of space?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore &amp; Mine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dig Deep into the Asteroid:</strong> Excavate the asteroid's core and uncover precious ores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607150/extras/b111f52e0088b6338f10fb34b3245f9a.poster.avif?t=1753348587\" width=536 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607150/extras/b111f52e0088b6338f10fb34b3245f9a.webm?t=1753348587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607150/extras/b111f52e0088b6338f10fb34b3245f9a.mp4?t=1753348587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Base</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Establish a Secure Outpost:</strong> Create a functional base to escape the harsh realities of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607150/extras/f37b8221edcc781d4be51c96aed81a48.poster.avif?t=1753348587\" width=536 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607150/extras/f37b8221edcc781d4be51c96aed81a48.webm?t=1753348587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607150/extras/f37b8221edcc781d4be51c96aed81a48.mp4?t=1753348587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Void</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage Your Oxygen Supply:</strong> In the unforgiving vacuum of space, oxygen is your most critical resource.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607150/extras/ed7dc1e6fe42bcf0ae5929b7bd09ed33.poster.avif?t=1753348587\" width=536 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607150/extras/ed7dc1e6fe42bcf0ae5929b7bd09ed33.webm?t=1753348587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607150/extras/ed7dc1e6fe42bcf0ae5929b7bd09ed33.mp4?t=1753348587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
